# QMI8658 sensor tests

Exercises identification at both strapped addresses, the control-register
sequence, one-read six-axis sampling including negative two's complement values,
temperature scaling, the lifecycle, and transport failure, against a recording
MCU platform that answers as the part does. No hardware is involved.
